function nav(){let roleplay=['Ficha','Inventário','Benção','Marcial'],system=['Raças','Classes e Trilhas','Habilidade','Passivas','Talentos','Perícias','Resumo','Biblioteca','Livro Completo','Calculadoras'];const navButtons=arr=>arr.map(t=>`<button data-page="${t}" class="${page===t?'active':''}">${t}</button>`).join('');$('#nav').innerHTML=`<section class="nav-section system"><div class="nav-section-title"><span>⚙ SISTEMA</span><button class="rune-toggle" data-collapse="system" title="Ocultar/mostrar Sistema">ᛟ</button></div><div class="nav" ${navCollapsed.system?'hidden':''}>${navButtons(system)}</div></section><section class="nav-section roleplay"><div class="nav-section-title"><span>⚔ ROLEPLAY</span><button class="rune-toggle" data-collapse="roleplay" title="Ocultar/mostrar Roleplay">ᚷ</button></div><div class="nav" ${navCollapsed.roleplay?'hidden':''}>${navButtons(roleplay)}</div></section>`;$('#nav').querySelectorAll('[data-collapse]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{let k=b.dataset.collapse;navCollapsed[k]=!navCollapsed[k];render()});$('#nav').querySelectorAll('[data-page]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{page=b.dataset.page;catalogView={powers:40,passives:40,blessing:20,talents:20};render()});$('#characterBar').innerHTML=`<select id="characterSelect">${state.characters.map((ch,i)=>`<option value="${i}" ${i===state.active?'selected':''}>${esc(ch.name||`Personagem ${i+1}`)} · Nv ${ch.level||1}</option>`).join('')}</select><button class="danger" id="deleteCharacter">Excluir personagem</button>`;$('#characterSelect').onchange=e=>{state.active=Number(e.target.value);save();render()};$('#deleteCharacter').onclick=()=>{if(state.characters.length===1){alert('Mantenha pelo menos um personagem.');return}if(confirm('Excluir este personagem?')){state.characters.splice(state.active,1);state.active=Math.max(0,state.active-1);save();render()}}}
function record(it,k,i){return `<div class="record"><div class="row"><b>${esc(it.name||'Registro sem nome')}</b><span class="pill">${esc(it.type||k)}</span><span class="pill">${esc(it.trail||it.class||'')}</span><button class="secondary" data-addfrom="${k}" data-i="${i}">Adicionar à ficha</button><button class="danger" data-delete="${k}" data-i="${i}">Excluir</button></div><p>${esc(it.description||it.effect||'Sem descrição')}</p><div class="meta">${esc([it.circle,it.cost,it.action,it.range,it.requirements].filter(Boolean).join(' · '))}</div></div>`}
